fc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寒夜读书三首 其二","author":"陆游","text":"韦编屡绝铁砚穿，口诵手钞那计年。\n不是爱书即欲死，任从人笑作书颠。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":6134,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寒夜读书三首 其一","author":"陆游","text":"北窗暖焰满炉红，夜半涛翻古桧风。\n老死爱书心不厌，来生恐堕蠹鱼中。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":6135,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寒夜读书三首 其三","author":"陆游","text":"忆昨从戎出渭滨，秋风金鼓震咸秦。\n鸢肩竟欠封侯相，三尺檠边老此身。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":6136,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寓舍闻禽声","author":"陆游","text":"日暖林梢鹎鵊鸣，稻陂无处不青青。\n老农睡足犹慵起，支枕东窗尽意听。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":6137,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寓蓬莱馆二首 其二","author":"陆游","text":"古驿萧萧独倚阑，角声催晚雨催寒。\n残年遇合应无日，犹说新丰强自宽。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":6138,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寓蓬莱馆二首 其一","author":"陆游","text":"桐叶吹残蕉叶黄，驿窗微雨送凄凉。\n长安许史无平素，莫恨栖栖立路旁。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":6139,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"悲秋四首 其一","author"